5. **Calculate the revenue from selling the remaining eggs:**
   \[
   \text{Revenue} = \text{Remaining eggs} \times \$2/\text{egg} = 9 \times 2 = \$18 \text{ per day}
   \]

Therefore, Janet makes \(\boxed{18}\) dollars every day at the farmers' market.
